  <h1 class="article-title">Window Graphics Rotterdam Centrum &mdash; Coolsingel, Markthal &amp; Witte de Withstraat</h1>

  <p class="bluf-answer">
    Window graphics in Rotterdam Centrum from &euro;250 &middot; 3&ndash;5 day lead time &middot; two-year warranty. Welstand zone-1 compliant vinyl for the historic city centre, Lijnbaan, Markthal and Witte de Withstraat locations.
  </p>

  <div class="article-meta">
    <span>Updated: May 2026</span>
    <span>Neighbourhood &times; Service</span>
    <span>Rotterdam Centrum</span>
  </div>

  <div class="article-body">

    <p>Rotterdam Centrum is the commercial and cultural heart of the city, stretching from the Coolsingel boulevard through the Lijnbaan shopping axis, across the Markthalplein and into the narrow streets of Witte de Withstraat. The district draws over 150,000 visitors on a typical Saturday, which means a shop window here is seen by more people in one afternoon than most suburban locations see in a month. Getting the graphic right matters &mdash; and getting the permit right matters equally.</p>

    <p>Rotterdam Centrum is classified as welstand zone-1, the municipality&rsquo;s strictest aesthetic-review tier. This applies to the entire binnenstad including Laurensbuurt, Scheepvaartkwartier and the protected Witte de With cultural corridor. Films covering more than 30% of a glazed surface, or applications in designated heritage streets, may require prior council approval. Alfa Reclame has been active in Centrum since 2012 &mdash; averaging ten to fifteen installations per month &mdash; and is familiar with both the welstand framework and the individual tenant guides operated by Lijnbaan Beheer and Beurstraverse management.</p>

    <h2>What we do in this neighbourhood</h2>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Heritage retail frontages (Witte de Withstraat, Markthalplein horeca cluster)</strong> &mdash; Cut-vinyl applications covering no more than 25% of the glass surface, colour palette matched to the building facade, with opening hours lettering and logo. For the dense restaurant belt around Markthal we deliver complete hospitality packages &mdash; logo, menu strip and frosted privacy band &mdash; within the standard 3&ndash;5 day lead time.</li>
      <li><strong>Lijnbaan and Beurstraverse shopping-centre tenants</strong> &mdash; Large-format lettering readable at walking pace, cut vinyl in tenant-guide compliant colours. We prepare design documentation for centre management sign-off so you do not have to handle the paperwork.</li>
      <li><strong>Coolsingel and Weena office facades</strong> &mdash; Frosted privacy film for boardroom and consulting-room glass (Hexis Crystal 3200, compatible with double glazing) and corporate logo lettering on large curtain-wall surfaces. Installation is scheduled outside office hours at no surcharge.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Pricing guide</h2>

    <table class="price-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Application type</th><th>Typical size</th><th>From</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Logo + name lettering</td><td>up to 60 &times; 30 cm</td><td>&euro;250</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Full storefront (cut vinyl)</td><td>up to 150 &times; 80 cm</td><td>&euro;399</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Frosted privacy strip</td><td>up to 200 &times; 40 cm</td><td>&euro;189</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Full-colour print film</td><td>per m&sup2;</td><td>&euro;95/m&sup2;</td></tr>
        <tr><td>One-way vision (perforated)</td><td>per m&sup2;</td><td>&euro;89/m&sup2;</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>All prices include 21% Dutch VAT, design, A-brand vinyl and on-site installation in Centrum. Where a welstand application is required we notify you of the municipal fee in advance.</p>

    <h2>Process</h2>

    <ol>
      <li><strong>WhatsApp contact</strong> &mdash; Send a photograph of the window with a short brief. Reply within one hour on weekdays.</li>
      <li><strong>Free digital mockup within 48 hours</strong> &mdash; Welstand-compliant design; unlimited revisions at no charge.</li>
      <li><strong>Production in Rotterdam</strong> &mdash; 1&ndash;3 working days after approval, using A-brand 3M IJ180Cv3 cast vinyl.</li>
      <li><strong>On-site installation in Centrum</strong> &mdash; Glass cleaned, bubble-free application, site left tidy. Total 3&ndash;5 days from first contact.</li>
    </ol>

